    "text": "tricitytimes-online.com\nwebsite\nAlmont\nAlmont outscores Yale, 49-34\nBy Kevin Kissane,\n1 days agoALMONT — Almont outscored host Yale, 49-34, in a Blue Water Area Conference varsity football game last Friday night. With the outcome, Almont goes to 3-0 and 2-0. Yale slips to 1-2 and 1-1. In Friday’s game, Almont and Yale ended the opening quarter with 14 points each.",
